{"page":462,"verses":[{"verse_key":"39:32","surah":39,"ayah":32,"ar_uthmani":"۞ فَمَنْ أَظْلَمُ مِمَّن كَذَبَ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ وَكَذَّبَ بِٱلصِّدْقِ إِذْ جَآءَهُۥٓ ۚ أَلَيْسَ فِى جَهَنَّمَ مَثْوًى لِّلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So who could be more wrong than the person who invents a lie about God and rejects the truth when it comes to him? Is there not ample punishment for the disbelievers in Hell?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ فَمَنْ","en_gloss":"Then who","transliteration":"faman","verse_key":"39:32"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَظْلَمُ","en_gloss":"(is) more unjust","transliteration":"aẓlamu","verse_key":"39:32"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِمَّن","en_gloss":"than (one) who","transliteration":"mimman","verse_key":"39:32"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَذَبَ","en_gloss":"lies","transliteration":"kadhaba","verse_key":"39:32"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"against","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"39:32"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"39:32"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَكَذَّبَ","en_gloss":"and denies","transliteration":"wakadhaba","verse_key":"39:32"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِٱلصِّدْقِ","en_gloss":"the truth","transliteration":"bil-ṣid'qi","verse_key":"39:32"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"39:32"},{"pos":10,"ar":"جَآءَهُۥٓ ۚ","en_gloss":"it comes to him","transliteration":"jāahu","verse_key":"39:32"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَلَيْسَ","en_gloss":"Is (there) not","transliteration":"alaysa","verse_key":"39:32"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"39:32"},{"pos":13,"ar":"جَهَنَّمَ","en_gloss":"Hell","transliteration":"jahannama","verse_key":"39:32"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مَثْوًۭى","en_gloss":"an abode","transliteration":"mathwan","verse_key":"39:32"},{"pos":15,"ar":"لِّلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_gloss":"for the disbelievers","transliteration":"lil'kāfirīna","verse_key":"39:32"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٣٢","en_gloss":"(32)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"39:32"}]},{"verse_key":"39:33","surah":39,"ayah":33,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِى جَآءَ بِٱلصِّدْقِ وَصَدَّقَ بِهِۦٓ ۙ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلْمُتَّقُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It is the one who brings the truth and the one who accepts it as true who are mindful of God:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"And the one who","transliteration":"wa-alladhī","verse_key":"39:33"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَآءَ","en_gloss":"brought","transliteration":"jāa","verse_key":"39:33"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِٱلصِّدْقِ","en_gloss":"the truth","transliteration":"bil-ṣid'qi","verse_key":"39:33"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَصَدَّقَ","en_gloss":"and believed","transliteration":"waṣaddaqa","verse_key":"39:33"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِهِۦٓ ۙ","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"39:33"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"those","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"39:33"},{"pos":7,"ar":"هُمُ","en_gloss":"[they]","transliteration":"humu","verse_key":"39:33"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْمُتَّقُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) the righteous","transliteration":"l-mutaqūna","verse_key":"39:33"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٣٣","en_gloss":"(33)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"39:33"}]},{"verse_key":"39:34","surah":39,"ayah":34,"ar_uthmani":"لَهُم مَّا يَشَآءُونَ عِندَ رَبِّهِمْ ۚ ذَٰلِكَ جَزَآءُ ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"they will have everything they wish for with their Lord. Such is the reward of those who do good:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَهُم","en_gloss":"For them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"39:34"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"(is) what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"39:34"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَشَآءُونَ","en_gloss":"they wish","transliteration":"yashāūna","verse_key":"39:34"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عِندَ","en_gloss":"with","transliteration":"ʿinda","verse_key":"39:34"},{"pos":5,"ar":"رَبِّهِمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"their Lord","transliteration":"rabbihim","verse_key":"39:34"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"That","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"39:34"},{"pos":7,"ar":"جَزَآءُ","en_gloss":"(is the) reward","transliteration":"jazāu","verse_key":"39:34"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) the good-doers","transliteration":"l-muḥ'sinīna","verse_key":"39:34"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٣٤","en_gloss":"(34)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"39:34"}]},{"verse_key":"39:35","surah":39,"ayah":35,"ar_uthmani":"لِيُكَفِّرَ ٱللَّهُ عَنْهُمْ أَسْوَأَ ٱلَّذِى عَمِلُوا۟ وَيَجْزِيَهُمْ أَجْرَهُم بِأَحْسَنِ ٱلَّذِى كَانُوا۟ يَعْمَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God will absolve them even of their worst deeds and will reward them according to their best.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لِيُكَفِّرَ","en_gloss":"That Allah will remove","transliteration":"liyukaffira","verse_key":"39:35"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"That Allah will remove","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"39:35"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"from them","transliteration":"ʿanhum","verse_key":"39:35"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَسْوَأَ","en_gloss":"(the) worst","transliteration":"aswa-a","verse_key":"39:35"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"(of) what","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"39:35"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَمِلُوا۟","en_gloss":"they did","transliteration":"ʿamilū","verse_key":"39:35"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَيَجْزِيَهُمْ","en_gloss":"and reward them","transliteration":"wayajziyahum","verse_key":"39:35"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَجْرَهُم","en_gloss":"their due","transliteration":"ajrahum","verse_key":"39:35"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بِأَحْسَنِ","en_gloss":"for (the) best","transliteration":"bi-aḥsani","verse_key":"39:35"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"(of) what","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"39:35"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they used to","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"39:35"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَعْمَلُونَ","en_gloss":"do","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","verse_key":"39:35"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٣٥","en_gloss":"(35)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"39:35"}]},{"verse_key":"39:36","surah":39,"ayah":36,"ar_uthmani":"أَلَيْسَ ٱللَّهُ بِكَافٍ عَبْدَهُۥ ۖ وَيُخَوِّفُونَكَ بِٱلَّذِينَ مِن دُونِهِۦ ۚ وَمَن يُضْلِلِ ٱللَّهُ فَمَا لَهُۥ مِنْ هَادٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Is God not enough for His servant? Yet they threaten you [Prophet] with those they worship other than Him. If God allows someone to stray he has no one to guide him;","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَلَيْسَ","en_gloss":"Is not","transliteration":"alaysa","verse_key":"39:36"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"39:36"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِكَافٍ","en_gloss":"sufficient","transliteration":"bikāfin","verse_key":"39:36"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَبْدَهُۥ ۖ","en_gloss":"(for) His slave","transliteration":"ʿabdahu","verse_key":"39:36"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَيُخَوِّفُونَكَ","en_gloss":"And they threaten you","transliteration":"wayukhawwifūnaka","verse_key":"39:36"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"with those","transliteration":"bi-alladhīna","verse_key":"39:36"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"besides Him","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"39:36"},{"pos":8,"ar":"دُونِهِۦ ۚ","en_gloss":"besides Him","transliteration":"dūnihi","verse_key":"39:36"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"39:36"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يُضْلِلِ","en_gloss":"Allah lets go astray ","transliteration":"yuḍ'lili","verse_key":"39:36"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah lets go astray ","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"39:36"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فَمَا","en_gloss":"then not","transliteration":"famā","verse_key":"39:36"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"for him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"39:36"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"39:36"},{"pos":15,"ar":"هَادٍۢ","en_gloss":"guide","transliteration":"hādin","verse_key":"39:36"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٣٦","en_gloss":"(36)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"39:36"}]},{"verse_key":"39:37","surah":39,"ayah":37,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَن يَهْدِ ٱللَّهُ فَمَا لَهُۥ مِن مُّضِلٍّ ۗ أَلَيْسَ ٱللَّهُ بِعَزِيزٍ ذِى ٱنتِقَامٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"if God guides someone no one can lead him astray. Is God not mighty and capable of retribution?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"39:37"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَهْدِ","en_gloss":"Allah guides","transliteration":"yahdi","verse_key":"39:37"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah guides","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"39:37"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَمَا","en_gloss":"then not","transliteration":"famā","verse_key":"39:37"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"for him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"39:37"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"39:37"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مُّضِلٍّ ۗ","en_gloss":"misleader","transliteration":"muḍillin","verse_key":"39:37"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَلَيْسَ","en_gloss":"Is not","transliteration":"alaysa","verse_key":"39:37"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"39:37"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِعَزِيزٍۢ","en_gloss":"All-Mighty","transliteration":"biʿazīzin","verse_key":"39:37"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ذِى","en_gloss":"All-Able of retribution","transliteration":"dhī","verse_key":"39:37"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱنتِقَامٍۢ","en_gloss":"All-Able of retribution","transliteration":"intiqāmin","verse_key":"39:37"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٣٧","en_gloss":"(37)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"39:37"}]},{"verse_key":"39:38","surah":39,"ayah":38,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَئِن سَأَلْتَهُم مَّنْ خَلَقَ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضَ لَيَقُولُنَّ ٱللَّهُ ۚ قُلْ أَفَرَءَيْتُم مَّا تَدْعُونَ مِن دُونِ ٱللَّهِ إِنْ أَرَادَنِىَ ٱللَّهُ بِضُرٍّ هَلْ هُنَّ كَـٰشِفَـٰتُ ضُرِّهِۦٓ أَوْ أَرَادَنِى بِرَحْمَةٍ هَلْ هُنَّ مُمْسِكَـٰتُ رَحْمَتِهِۦ ۚ قُلْ حَسْبِىَ ٱللَّهُ ۖ عَلَيْهِ يَتَوَكَّلُ ٱلْمُتَوَكِّلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If you [Prophet] ask them, ‘Who created the heavens and earth?’ they are sure to answer, ‘God,’ so say, ‘Consider those you invoke beside Him: if God wished to harm me, could they undo that harm? If God wished to show me mercy, could they withhold that mercy?’ Say, ‘God is enough for me: all those who trust should put their trust in Him.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَئِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wala-in","verse_key":"39:38"},{"pos":2,"ar":"سَأَلْتَهُم","en_gloss":"you ask them","transliteration":"sa-altahum","verse_key":"39:38"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَّنْ","en_gloss":"who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"39:38"},{"pos":4,"ar":"خَلَقَ","en_gloss":"created","transliteration":"khalaqa","verse_key":"39:38"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"39:38"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضَ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍa","verse_key":"39:38"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَيَقُولُنَّ","en_gloss":"Surely, they will say","transliteration":"layaqūlunna","verse_key":"39:38"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ ۚ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"39:38"},{"pos":9,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"39:38"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَفَرَءَيْتُم","en_gloss":"Then do you see","transliteration":"afara-aytum","verse_key":"39:38"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"39:38"},{"pos":12,"ar":"تَدْعُونَ","en_gloss":"you invoke","transliteration":"tadʿūna","verse_key":"39:38"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"besides","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"39:38"},{"pos":14,"ar":"دُونِ","en_gloss":"besides","transliteration":"dūni","verse_key":"39:38"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"39:38"},{"pos":16,"ar":"إِنْ","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"39:38"},{"pos":17,"ar":"أَرَادَنِىَ","en_gloss":"Allah intended for me","transliteration":"arādaniya","verse_key":"39:38"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah intended for me","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"39:38"},{"pos":19,"ar":"بِضُرٍّ","en_gloss":"harm","transliteration":"biḍurrin","verse_key":"39:38"},{"pos":20,"ar":"هَلْ","en_gloss":"are","transliteration":"hal","verse_k