","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"39:39"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَـٰقَوْمِ","en_gloss":"O my people","transliteration":"yāqawmi","verse_key":"39:39"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱعْمَلُوا۟","en_gloss":"Work","transliteration":"iʿ'malū","verse_key":"39:39"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"(according) to","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"39:39"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَكَانَتِكُمْ","en_gloss":"your position","transliteration":"makānatikum","verse_key":"39:39"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِنِّى","en_gloss":"indeed, I am","transliteration":"innī","verse_key":"39:39"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَـٰمِلٌۭ ۖ","en_gloss":"working","transliteration":"ʿāmilun","verse_key":"39:39"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَسَوْفَ","en_gloss":"then soon","transliteration":"fasawfa","verse_key":"39:39"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"you will know","transliteration":"taʿlamūna","verse_key":"39:39"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٣٩","en_gloss":"(39)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"39:39"}]},{"verse_key":"39:40","surah":39,"ayah":40,"ar_uthmani":"مَن يَأْتِيهِ عَذَابٌ يُخْزِيهِ وَيَحِلُّ عَلَيْهِ عَذَابٌ مُّقِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"who will suffer humiliation, and on whom a lasting torment will descend.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"(Upon) whom","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"39:40"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَأْتِيهِ","en_gloss":"will come","transliteration":"yatīhi","verse_key":"39:40"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَذَابٌۭ","en_gloss":"a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","verse_key":"39:40"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يُخْزِيهِ","en_gloss":"disgracing him","transliteration":"yukh'zīhi","verse_key":"39:40"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَيَحِلُّ","en_gloss":"and descends","transliteration":"wayaḥillu","verse_key":"39:40"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"on him","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","verse_key":"39:40"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَذَابٌۭ","en_gloss":"a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","verse_key":"39:40"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مُّقِيمٌ","en_gloss":"everlasting","transliteration":"muqīmun","verse_key":"39:40"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٤٠","en_gloss